# The prebuilt FAISS index IS committed (data/index/) so a deployed demo works
# without re-running ingestion, OCR and embedding on first load. It is public
# municipal data, not a secret. If the corpus changes, rebuild and re-commit:
#   python src/ingest.py && python src/ocr.py && python src/chunk_index.py
